### IntelliJ IDEA ###
# The whole directory. It was partly tracked before, which is the worst of both: the IDE
# rewrites gradle.xml and misc.xml whenever a module is added or the project is renamed, so
# those files turned up in unrelated commits as noise nobody had asked for.
.idea/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
out/
!**/src/main/**/out/
!**/src/test/**/out/

